[00:21.98]1. God is love, and he invites us:
[00:26.46]‘Walk with me and love my way.’
[00:31.66]When we love both God and neighbor,
[00:37.39]Gracious deeds will fill each day.
[00:41.39]Therein lies the key to living;
[00:46.39]Therein lies the life we seek.
[00:53.56]Christlike love will never fail us;
[00:59.56]Christlike love through us will speak.
[01:14.68]2. Love of truth moves us to action;
[01:19.42]Love of God moves us to love.
[01:24.50]When we fail he seeks to help us;
[01:30.28]By his strength we rise above.
[01:35.28]Love is pure and never jealous;
[01:40.28]Love is kind and bears all things.
[01:46.46]May we grow to love our brother;
[01:52.89]May we taste what true love brings.
[02:02.39]3. Never let resentment lead you;
[02:11.89]May it never take your hand.
[02:16.03]Look to God, and he will guide you;
[02:22.03]He will teach you these commands:
[02:27.03]Love of God and love of neighbor,
[02:32.03]Ev’rything that love should be.
[02:39.55]May we always show to others
[02:48.00]Godlike love, yes, tenderly.